r (such as a car). Do not shelter under or near trees, or other structures which may be struck by lightning. If you are on an elevated area, move to lower ground.\n\nPeople cope better with power cuts when they have prepared for them in advance. It's easy to do; consider gathering torches and batteries, a mobile phone power pack and other essential items.\n\nConsider if your location is at risk of flash flooding. If so, consider preparing a flood plan and an emergency flood kit.\n\nBe prepared for weather warnings to change quickly: when a weather warning is issued, the Met Office recommends staying up to date with the weather forecast in your area.","language":"en-GB","onset":"2026-08-30T10:00:00+00:00","parameter":[{"value":"2; Yellow; Moderate","valueName":"awareness_level"},{"value":"3; Thunderstorm","valueName":"awareness_type"},{"value":"There is a good chance driving conditions will be affected by spray, standing water and/or hail, leading to longer journey times by car and bus","valueName":"impacts"},{"value":"Probably some damage to a few buildings and structures from lightning strikes","valueName":"impacts"},{"value":"Delays to train services are possible","valueName":"impacts"},{"value":"Some short-term loss of power and other services is possible","valueName":"impacts"},{"value":"Some flooding of a few homes and businesses possible, leading to some damage to buildings or structures","valueName":"impacts"}],"responseType":["Prepare"],"senderName":"UK Met Office","severity":"Moderate","urgency":"Future","web":"https://www.metoffice.gov.uk/weather/warnings-and-advice/uk-warnings"}],"msgType":"Alert","scope":"Public","sender":"https://www.metoffice.gov.uk/weather/warnings-and-advice/uk-warnings","sent":"2026-08-30T07:48:20+00:00","source":"2.49.0.0.826.0.GB","status":"Actual"},"raw_properties":{"supersededByAlertId":null,"supersededAt":null,"supersedeType":null,"geometryDescription":"geometry is bbox only, link (member of the feature's links array) with type application/geo+json points to geojson describing the exact shape","geometryType":"bbox","OBJECTID":"89ec8f88-49d0-4bbd-9a9d-f627bef72c45","alertId":"7b7c38fd-fd73-4250-98c2-90bd44987e07","countryCode":"UK","featureType":"polygon","hubLanguage":"en-GB","indexArea":0,"indexFeature":1,"indexInfo":0,"hubTime":"2026-08-30T07:49:31Z","hubLink":"https://meteo.fra1.digitaloceanspaces.com/api/archive/warnings/7b7c38fd-fd73-4250-98c2-90bd44987e07.xml?AWSAccessKeyId=DO00LYPLJBWUUWC6D6NU&Expires=1788089122&Signature=f4IHX0QLaWhdT0v4h2o2DjazOMM%3D"}}]}